      {
        "id": "E2",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "As an enterprise administrator, you can now require selected GitHub Copilot customizations to come from plugins or managed settings, rather than standalone user or project configuration.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://github.blog/changelog/2026-11-16-control-where-github-copilot-customizations-come-from",
        "source": "GitHub Changelog",
        "publishedAt": "2026-11-16T19:48:33.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-11-17T04:28:34.196Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E3",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "Choose which customizations require plugins",
        "sourceUrl": "https://github.blog/changelog/2026-11-16-control-where-github-copilot-customizations-come-from",
        "source": "GitHub Changelog",
        "publishedAt": "2026-11-16T19:48:33.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-11-17T04:28:34.196Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E4",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "The strictPluginOnlyCustomization managed setting blocks standalone customizations from user and project sources.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://github.blog/changelog/2026-11-16-control-where-github-copilot-customizations-come-from",
        "source": "GitHub Changelog",
        "publishedAt": "2026-11-16T19:48:33.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-11-17T04:28:34.196Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E5",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "You can apply the restriction to all five supported categories or select individual ones: skills, custom agents, hooks, MCP servers, and executable Copilot extensions.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://github.blog/changelog/2026-11-16-control-where-github-copilot-customizations-come-from",
        "source": "GitHub Changelog",
        "publishedAt": "2026-11-16T19:48:33.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-11-17T04:28:34.196Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E6",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "Enterprise administrators can configure these controls on GitHub Enterprise Cloud for members with Copilot Business or Copilot Enterprise licenses issued by the enterprise or one of its organizations.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://github.blog/changelog/2026-11-16-control-where-github-copilot-customizations-come-from",
        "source": "GitHub Changelog",
